---
import '@luminedge/styles/index.css';
import '../styles/site.css';

const colors = [
  { name: '主色', token: '--le-color-primary', color: '#3386ff' },
  { name: '辅色', token: '--le-color-secondary', color: '#faa201' },
  { name: '成功', token: '--le-color-success', color: '#00ce53' },
  { name: '警告', token: '--le-color-warning', color: '#ffb42b' },
  { name: '危险', token: '--le-color-danger', color: '#f90c0c' },
  { name: '文字', token: '--le-color-text', color: '#212529' },
];
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content="Luminedge 设计变量与组件展示。" />
    <title>Luminedge — 设计与组件</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="site-header">
      <a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="Luminedge 首页">
        <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">✳</span>
        <span>Luminedge</span>
      </a>
      <nav aria-label="页面导航">
        <a href="#colors">色彩</a>
        <a href="#components">组件</a>
        <a href="#usage">使用方式</a>
      </nav>
      <span class="release-label">DESIGN SYSTEM <span> / 0.1</span></span>
    </header>

    <main id="top">
      <section class="hero">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span> A NATURAL INTERFACE</p>
          <h1>让界面，<br /><em>多一点光。</em></h1>
          <p class="hero-copy">一套自然、友好而优雅的设计语言。从一抹颜色到一次交互，留意每一个细节。</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="le-button" href="#components">探索组件 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
            <a class="hero-link" href="#colors">查看设计变量 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-visual" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="visual-orbit orbit-one"></div>
          <div class="visual-orbit orbit-two"></div>
          <div class="visual-core"><span>✳</span></div>
          <span class="visual-caption">DESIGNED FOR<br />EVERYDAY MOMENTS</span>
          <span class="visual-index">01 — 04</span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section" id="colors">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <div><p class="eyebrow">01 / FOUNDATIONS</p><h2>色彩</h2></div>
          <p>从原有配色出发，用设计变量让颜色在不同界面中保持一致。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="palette">
          {colors.map(({ name, token, color }) => (
            <article class="swatch">
              <div class="swatch-color" style={`background: var(${token})`}></div>
              <div class="swatch-info"><strong>{name}</strong><span>{color.toUpperCase()}</span></div>
              <code>{token}</code>
            </article>
          ))}
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section" id="components">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <div><p class="eyebrow">02 / COMPONENTS</p><h2>从细节开始</h2></div>
          <p>从基础样式到交互行为，组件共享同一套视觉语言。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="component-grid">
          <article class="showcase showcase-buttons">
            <div class="showcase-heading"><span>01</span><h3>按钮</h3><span>BUTTON</span></div>
            <div class="showcase-body button-row">
              <button class="le-button" type="button">主要操作</button>
              <button class="le-button le-button--secondary" type="button">次要操作</button>
              <button class="le-button" type="button" disabled>不可用</button>
            </div>
            <p>清晰的层级与状态，让每一次点击都更从容。</p>
          </article>
          <article class="showcase showcase-card">
            <div class="showcase-heading"><span>02</span><h3>卡片与头像</h3><span>CARD / AVATAR</span></div>
            <div class="showcase-body">
              <div class="le-card sample-card">
                <div class="le-avatar" aria-hidden="true">L</div>
                <div><strong>今天也有好灵感</strong><p>记录每一个值得留意的瞬间。</p></div>
                <span class="sample-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p>柔和的边界，给内容恰到好处的空间。</p>
          </article>
          <article class="showcase showcase-dialog">
            <div class="showcase-heading"><span>03</span><h3>弹窗</h3><span>DIALOG</span></div>
            <div class="showcase-body dialog-demo">
              <div><strong>需要用户做出选择时</strong><p>在清晰、专注的空间里继续。</p></div>
              <button class="le-button le-button--secondary" type="button" data-dialog-open>打开弹窗 ↗</button>
            </div>
            <p>样式由 CSS 提供，交互使用浏览器原生弹窗。</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section usage" id="usage">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">03 / GETTING STARTED</p>
          <h2>按你的方式使用。</h2>
          <p>单独使用样式，或通过统一入口一起使用样式和交互组件。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="code-card">
          <div class="code-label"><span>统一入口</span><span>JAVASCRIPT</span></div>
          <pre><code>import '@luminedge/ui/styles.css';
import &#123; createDialog &#125; from '@luminedge/ui';</code></pre>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer"><strong>✳ &nbsp; Luminedge</strong><span>Natural, friendly, elegant.</span></footer>

    <dialog class="le-dialog" id="example-dialog" aria-labelledby="dialog-title" aria-describedby="dialog-description">
      <div class="dialog-icon" aria-hidden="true">✳</div>
      <h2 id="dialog-title">给灵感一点空间</h2>
      <p id="dialog-description">这个弹窗组合了样式包与交互封装，并使用浏览器原生的对话框行为。</p>
      <div class="dialog-actions">
        <button class="le-button le-button--secondary" type="button" data-dialog-close>关闭</button>
        <button class="le-button" type="button" data-dialog-close autofocus>明白了</button>
      </div>
    </dialog>
    <script>
      import { createDialog } from '@luminedge/ui';

      const dialog = document.querySelector('#example-dialog');
      if (dialog instanceof HTMLDialogElement) {
        createDialog(dialog, {
          openTriggers: document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-dialog-open]'),
          closeTriggers: document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-dialog-close]'),
        });
      }
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
